      "writtenOn": "2020-01-17T02:34:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "setNcmTethering has same structure with setUsbTethering(). Are there any problems in setUsbTethering()? I don\u0027t see any differences between setUsbTethering() and setNcmTethering()",
